{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"It kinda is, but they also kinda sent me here mostly so I'm out of the way. So my younger brother takes over our family's part of the influence in town. Which, I really don't care. Empire City has many more machines. And if I manage to actually get anything done towards their goal on the side, then sure, we all win.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T18:21:18.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867833705274933258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...that's. Who would want you out of the way? You're kind, and funny, and---you gave me a purpose for living!' she gets up and starts pacing. 'And people want you just out of the way? You're too important for that... At least to me.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T18:23:25.473000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867834236127805450","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
