{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...thank you. And I honestly wouldn't mind the buzzing. It's fascinating.'\nshe eats some of the food, before continuing, 'This is what I mean though. You actually care about me. I'm not... used to it. I don't know if I ever had family or anything like that.'","created_at":"2021-07-22T18:45:12.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867839718985039893","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
